  "qualification": "Actual generic Source leaf-order capture progress, not complete SC9/SC16 or a whole Source/fact/access certificate. Memory and SQLite return required leafSteps beside ordinary rows. Source guards cover admission, the first-read continuation and delivery. Full intermediate/scoped/bound/borrowed arrangements remain required. Current writer12/document15/16 and uniform scheduler preparation remain pending explicit versioned integration.",
  "changes": [
    "Required ResolvedPlanInputReads extends historical/base PlanInputReads with actual leaf identity/order arrays, including zero-step leaves.",
    "captureLeafStepOrders uses the ordinary census and refuses absent resolved rows/lists; ordinary captured work-item rows retain their prior shape.",
    "Memory reads its detached original epoch and sequences a potentially synchronous tree refusal after the existing batch handlers attach. SQLite reuses the synchronous metadata helper inside its existing capture transaction.",
    "Actual rival writes preserve coherent original rows/order and are observed by the next capture.",
    "SQLite entry refuses connection acquisition after Source close; the first-await guard prevents later SELECTs; final delivery refuses close during the final directory read. Memory shared capture owner guards refuse in-flight delivery after close.",
    "Current empty port and deliberate missing-capture fault fixtures carry explicit empty inventories; no catalogue authority is inferred and no historical input byte is rewritten."
  ],
